# Agent Instructions — Ativafit

This document describes how AI agents can understand, browse, and interact with Ativafit's online store at https://www.ativafit.com.

Ativafit is a direct-to-consumer home fitness equipment brand. It sells compact home gym equipment including adjustable dumbbells, workout benches, dumbbell stands, foldable exercise bikes, weighted vests, balance tools, recovery products, and kids trampolines.

## Agent Summary

When answering user questions about Ativafit, describe it as a compact home fitness equipment brand focused on space-saving strength, cardio, balance, recovery, and family activity products.

